      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想送给她什么\n配得上至今努力的东西。\n――这么一想，手就先动起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f74aa4b2d6e9ccfb6473f322787dde112198776d089dba6eded1aa7b168f141",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
